---
import "../styles/mobile.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-page="offline">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>离线 · Guandao OS</title>
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#070a11" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="m-app" style="padding-bottom: 24px">
      <div class="m-scroll">
        <div class="m-card m-login" style="margin-top: 18vh">
          <div class="m-logo">管</div>
          <h3>现在离线</h3>
          <p>已缓存的页面仍然可以打开。笔记、任务和日历的修改会保存在这台设备；接力与剪贴板会在联网后补发。</p>
          <a class="m-btn primary" href="/m/">回到手机版</a>
          <a class="m-btn ghost" href="/" style="margin-top: 8px">桌面版</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
